  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Do I need to eat boiled chicken and broccoli for weight loss?",
      "a": "Bilkul nahi! Aap ghar ka khana (roti, dal, sabzi) khakar bhi weight lose kar sakte hain. Bas hume portions aur total calories ko manage karna hota hai."
    },
    {
      "q": "Mere paas gym jane ka time nahi hai. Can I workout at home?",
      "a": "Yes. Humare paas specially designed home-workout plans hain using resistance bands aur bodyweight, jo gym jaise hi results dete hain."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is online coaching really effective?",
      "a": "Yes, 70% of my clients are online! App ke through mai apki progress (weight, pictures, workout logs) roz track karta hu aur weekend pe video call check-in hota hai."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you prescribe supplements like protein powder?",
      "a": "Whey protein completely safe aur convenient source hai veg diet me protein badhane ka. But agar apko supplements nahi lene, toh hum diet chart ko usi hisab se adjust karte hain."
    }
  ],
